)","url":"https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:731955-1"},{"grupo":"Forma de vida","k":"Clima","v":"templado","fuente":"WCVP (Kew)","url":"https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:731955-1"}]}